  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: out-of-bounds repeat stack access in regexps\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-110264.patch: reject patterns whose range-repeat\n       or null-check count overflows the ID type in regcomp.c\n     - CVE-2026-110264\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: wrapped jump offsets in compiled regexps\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-93577-CVE-2026-97229.patch: check quantifier\n       expansion without int overflow and cap program size in regcomp.c\n     - CVE-2026-93577\n     - CVE-2026-97229\n   * Fix build-time test failures:\n     - debian/tests/excludes: skip the DTrace probe and two permission tests,\n       which fail when the test suite runs as root, the TLS tests whose\n       test certificates expired and the EADDRINUSE local bind tests",
